{"id":"wb-5-431","name":"胡氏古民居建筑","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"胡氏古民居建筑","text":"胡氏古民居建筑位于中国甘肃省天水市秦州区，分南宅子、北宅子两部分，隔街相望。1963年被列为县级文物保护单位，1981年被列为甘肃省文物保护单位，2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n南宅子现辟为天水民俗博物馆。\n胡氏古民居始建于明嘉靖年间，由举人胡来缙修建，后胡氏子孙世代居住。现存建筑八座二十六间、垂花门一座、影壁三座，占地2350平方米。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%83%A1%E6%B0%8F%E5%8F%A4%E6%B0%91%E5%B1%85%E5%BB%BA%E7%AD%91","revisionId":90814982,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90814982","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d4892bc99526011cc5bfa57b.jpg","title":"Tianshui_Hushi_Guminju_Jianzu_2014.01.03_15-02-11.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tianshui_Hushi_Guminju_Jianzu_2014.01.03_15-02-11.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ad/Tianshui_Hushi_Guminju_Jianzu_2014.01.03_15-02-11.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"天水胡氏古民居建筑","width":320,"height":213}}